# PismoPorts ports tree.
#
# Local file:// source, never rsync. The tree is pinned to a snapshot taken
# just before upstream dropped Tiger, plus this project's own G3 fixes; a sync
# would pull in ports that no longer support darwin 8 and undo them.
#
# [default] makes this the tree PortGroups are resolved from as well as ports.
# [nosync] stops `port sync` and `port selfupdate` touching it.
file:///opt/local/share/pismoports/ports [default,nosync]
